  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 203.27 Appeal of Administrative Sanction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 203.27 Appeal of Administrative Sanction. Except as otherwise provided by law, any suspension or revocation resulting from administrative action shall remain in full force and effect pending the outcome of the appeal or expiration of the sanction imposed.\n\nSource. #7349, eff 8-22-00; ss by #8230-A, eff 12-17-04 (formerly Saf-C 203.26)",
